<title>TAIWAN: Liton to issue US$66-72 mln Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Liton to issue US$66-72 mln Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Liton Electronic Corp said on Friday it would issue a five-year Eurobond worth some US$66-72 million to finance the manufacturer's expansion.  </p>
<p>The coupon rate on the Eurobond is 0.5-1 percent, a company statement said.</p>
<p>The company would hold roadshows in the United States, Europe and Asia June 11-19.</p>
<p>Further details were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
